  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that may be familiar with or perpetuates the racist trope of equating Black people with monkeys, which is used to dehumanize and demean Black individuals. The visual of monkeys and the text 'put chains on it' are coded references to this stereotype, implying inherent inferiority and incapability under restraint — a concept rooted in historical racism and pseudoscience.",
